{
  "id": "default_horizontal",
  "name": "Default Horizontal",
  "cardSizeId": "h86x54",
  "background": "@white",
  "_comment": [
    "All units are millimetres from the top-left of the trimmed 86 x 54 mm card.",
    "The 38.1 mm photo is 71% of a 54 mm card height, so a horizontal card cannot",
    "carry a deep masthead. Layout is therefore two columns below a slim header,",
    "matching the reference designs that put the photo left and the LABEL : VALUE",
    "rows right:",
    "  header      0.0 -> 11.0  full width",
    "  photo      12.5 -> 50.6  left column  (38.1 mm - FIXED)",
    "  name       12.5 -> 18.0  right column",
    "  fields     18.5 -> 49.5  right column (31.0 mm - roomy, unlike the vertical)"
  ],
  "elements": [
    {
      "type": "rect",
      "x": 0, "y": 0, "w": 86, "h": 11,
      "fill": "@header"
    },
    {
      "type": "logo",
      "x": 1.6, "y": 1.0, "w": 9, "h": 9
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "x": 12, "y": 0.9, "w": 59, "h": 5.6,
      "value": "{schoolName}",
      "size": 9,
      "bold": true,
      "color": "@white",
      "align": "left",
      "maxLines": 1
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "x": 12, "y": 6.4, "w": 59, "h": 3.8,
      "value": "{addressLine}",
      "size": 4.5,
      "color": "@white",
      "align": "left",
      "maxLines": 1
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "x": 72, "y": 1.6, "w": 12.4, "h": 7.6,
      "value": "{contactLine}",
      "size": 4.5,
      "color": "@white",
      "align": "right",
      "maxLines": 2
    },

    {
      "type": "photo",
      "x": 4, "y": 12.5, "w": 30.48, "h": 38.1,
      "borderWidth": 0.4,
      "borderColor": "@header"
    },

    {
      "type": "nameBanner",
      "x": 37, "y": 12.5, "w": 46, "h": 5.5,
      "size": 8,
      "color": "@primary",
      "align": "left"
    },

    {
      "type": "fields",
      "x": 37, "y": 18.5, "w": 46, "h": 31,
      "labelWidth": 15,
      "rowGap": 0.9,
      "showLabels": true,
      "exclude": ["name"]
    },

    {
      "type": "rect",
      "x": 0, "y": 52.6, "w": 86, "h": 1.4,
      "fill": "@header"
    }
  ]
}
